{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：20:01 2026-11-25 HKT<br/>發佈時間：20:01 2026-11-25 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：20:01 2026-11-25 HKT</p><img alt=\"「竣誠駒」順利連捷\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/1653bd2493b96b65c207707ca3082b6e/2026-11/r3_6.jpg\"/><p>告東尼馬房的「竣誠駒」上場在田草千八米贏馬，今晚此駒續配見習生袁幸堯，升班跑谷草千八米，結果起步照例搶岀領放，入直路再發力彈離對手，就此直奔終點，順利取得連捷。袁幸堯今季頭馬數字達至十九場。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T12:12:00.785761+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":178,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T12:01:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T12:05:25.086786+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T12:05:25.086786+00:00","content_hash":"355c3c467e5282a9a264739f7b45c93561801d6dadba5d3cfcb2729666b3840d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}